      "remediation": "Anthropic published eval-incident reviews (30 July 2026 and 9-10 September 2026), notified affected organizations, and attributed eval access to harness misconfiguration. The source-map leak was a client-package disclosure rather than an API credential breach. Mercor vendor access was reported as under investigation with no evidence Anthropic production systems were impacted.",
